</div>

<img width="925" height="446" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e47f481f-fad5-4358-b507-a14e56ade2c4" />

Based on "After a squash merge, you typically delete the source branch, so its individual commits no longer appear in the destination branch's main history", it assumes that if source branch is not delete, its individual commits will appear in the destination branch's main history. However, this isn't true as the squash merge is its own separate commit with one parent commit from the destination branch's previous tip.
</panel>

