The 75% does not mean that there is a bug. It is actually intended behaviour where your program is currently waiting for your input or for you to exit. This appears when you are using scanner.nextLine() to ask for input in your program. Your main concern for a "buggy" program should be when it shows "BUILD UNSUCCESSFUL" after you enter "bye" as your input.
