I think the main issue is that you accidentally switched into samplerepo-things instead of the samplerepo-finances repo created for the task. After that, changing origin to samplerepo-finances-2 caused Git to treat two unrelated repositories as one, which is why you got the “unrelated histories” error. Since you didn’t push anything, you should be able to reset  the hands-on task and try again from the correct folder.
</panel>

