## Library

[Beryl](https://github.com/Praneeth-Suresh/Beryl)

## Purpose

- This is a repository-level context management solution for coding agents, to ensure that natural language guidance does not lag behind code. It will be used in both projects to improve the agentic development experience.
- Keep context fresh about the project so that implementation can be more easily tracked, allowing the student to better understand the codebase and the design choices.
- Ensure that good software engineering principles are used throughout the project, under the paradigm of agentic SWE 
- Refine this open-source project based on what I learn about SWE.

